# W8-SEEN for a decision. E §7 step 1 as in E7_1_shared_line_random_day: top, a decision, books w on a random day; fee
# books v 100.00 DUK on the first of each month (opening 0.00 DUK), so bal(v, 2026-03-31) reaches no random fact:
# 300.00 DUK. snap9 refused it (top's refused day held for the whole walk).
=== m.tally
model m
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
unit DUK: currency minor 0.01
source s "s"
index delays = 1..10
place w: accounts DUK lives 2026-01-01..
place v: accounts DUK lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 2026-01-01..
input amt: money DUK question "amount?"
version o
  cite s
  known 2026-01-01
  opening[w] = 0.00 DUK at 2026-01-01 start
  opening[v] = 0.00 DUK at 2026-01-01 start
  amt = 100.00 DUK governs always "a"
def delay[m in months]: dist = discrete(1 for k in delays)
move top[m in months]: transfers
  on add_days(start_of(m), delay[m])
  reads w
  leg cash from world to w amount max(0.00 DUK, amt - bal(w, start_of(m)))
move fee[m in months]: transfers
  on start_of(m)
  leg cash from world to v amount amt
ask q6: bal(v, 2026-03-31) law 2026-12-31
=== expect
q6: 300.00 DUK
  law date 2026-12-31, cut 2026-01-01
